      chapter: "Study Findings"
      notes: """
        On to things that we learned from applying this lens.

        We did two studies, first a set of interviews with 12 experienced industry programmers where we asked them about their debugging process, then a study where we had 19 participants use different debugging tools for different bugs and qualitatively compared how they used them.

        And then lastly, I'll talk about using the Data-Oriented Debugging lens to understand 
      """
    }
