      notes: """
        We saw that programmers engaged in this sort of negotiation with the future, where they anticipated having not enough or too much information and adjusted their queries accordingly

        Which I take as evidence that there's something wrong with our debugging tools, if programmers are worried about what the tool will be able to help them with and that's affecting the path they take when debugging.
      """
    }
